{
  "uid": "twilight-validation",
  "title": "Twilight Validation",
  "tags": [
    "twilight",
    "validation"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 2,
  "editable": false,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "component",
        "label": "组件",
        "type": "custom",
        "hide": 0,
        "query": "Owner（会话与命令） : owner, Worker（执行与恢复） : worker, Model Backend（模型执行） : model-backend, Tool Backend（工具与工作区） : tool-backend",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "All",
            "value": "$__all",
            "selected": true
          },
          {
            "text": "Owner（会话与命令）",
            "value": "owner",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Worker（执行与恢复）",
            "value": "worker",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Model Backend（模型执行）",
            "value": "model-backend",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Tool Backend（工具与工作区）",
            "value": "tool-backend",
            "selected": false
          }
        ],
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all",
          "selected": true
        },
        "skipUrlSync": false
      },
      {
        "name": "pod",
        "label": "Pod / 副本",
        "type": "query",
        "hide": 0,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "twilight-prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(up{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\"}, pod)",
          "refId": "StandardVariableQuery"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(up{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\"}, pod)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "options": [],
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all",
          "selected": true
        },
        "skipUrlSync": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "先看这里：如何使用面板",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "description": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 总览 → 组件 → 副本 → 日志\n- 顶部 **组件** 默认全部展开；选择一个组件后，只看它的详情。**Pod** 用来定位具体副本；选单个 Pod 时，建议同时选择其所属组件。\n- 四个组件：**Owner** 接收命令/订阅事件；**Worker** 调度、核对和恢复执行；**Model Backend** 执行模型；**Tool Backend** 执行工具/管理工作区。\n- **普通 RPC、健康探针、流式端点分别展示**。RPC 完成数不是模型调用数；流式活跃请求不是每秒输出的 token 数。\n- `No data` / `暂无样本` 不代表故障：未发生某类请求或样本不足时可能空白。先看存活/就绪；没有 HTTP 错误也不能证明业务恢复成功。\n- 所有详情保留 **Pod** 区分。日志里的 Session/Execution ID 用于搜索，不是 metrics/stream labels。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "存活：每个 Pod 的指标端点",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "description": "1=Prometheus 能抓取 /metrics；0=抓取失败。不证明业务循环、数据库或模型供应商正常。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "twilight-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\",pod=~\"${pod:regex}\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{role}} / {{pod}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "暂无样本",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "状态"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 90
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "失败",
                        "color": "red"
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "正常",
                        "color": "green"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "组件"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 125
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "namespace": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "role": 0,
              "pod": 1,
              "Value": 2
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "role": "组件",
              "pod": "副本",
              "Value": "状态"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "就绪：最近一次检查",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "description": "1=最近一次 /readyz 成功；DB 组件检查本地数据库。不是持续依赖监控，也不检查外部模型供应商。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "twilight-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "twilight_ready{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\",pod=~\"${pod:regex}\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{role}} / {{pod}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "暂无样本",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "状态"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 90
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "失败",
                        "color": "red"
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "正常",
                        "color": "green"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "组件"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 125
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "namespace": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "role": 0,
              "pod": 1,
              "Value": 2
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "role": "组件",
              "pod": "副本",
              "Value": "状态"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "总览：普通 RPC 完成数 / 分钟（按组件）",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "description": "仅短请求：排除 /healthz、/readyz 和 SSE 端点。只在请求结束时计数；下方按组件/POD进一步定位。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "twilight-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (role) (rate(twilight_http_requests_total{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\",pod=~\"${pod:regex}\",route!~\"GET /(healthz|readyz)\",route!~\"GET /sessions/[^/]+/events|POST /(progress|settlements|notices)\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{role}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "暂无样本",
          "unit": "suffix:次/分钟",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "总览：执行边界结果（按组件）",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "description": "采样窗口内的 operation 次数。owned/not_ready 等可能是正常协议结果；dispatch_unknown 不是确定失败。没有相应操作时不伪造零样本。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "twilight-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (role, result) (increase(twilight_operations_total{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\",pod=~\"${pod:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{role}} · {{result}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "暂无样本",
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "${component:text} · 组件详情",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "description": "",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "repeat": "component",
      "repeatDirection": "v"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "普通 RPC 完成数 / 分钟",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "description": "当前组件各 Pod/接口的完成速率。不含健康探针和 SSE；不是模型或工具执行吞吐量。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "twilight-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (pod, route) (rate(twilight_http_requests_total{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\",pod=~\"${pod:regex}\",route!~\"GET /(healthz|readyz)\",route!~\"GET /sessions/[^/]+/events|POST /(progress|settlements|notices)\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}} · {{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "暂无样本",
          "unit": "suffix:次/分钟",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "普通 RPC：4xx / 5xx 次数 / 分钟",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 23,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "description": "4xx 多为无效请求/冲突/不存在，5xx 多为服务错误。已采到 RPC 流量但没有错误时显示零；未采到 RPC 流量时无样本。HTTP 成功不等于业务成功。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "twilight-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (pod, status) (rate(twilight_http_requests_total{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\",pod=~\"${pod:regex}\",route!~\"GET /(healthz|readyz)\",route!~\"GET /sessions/[^/]+/events|POST /(progress|settlements|notices)\",status=~\"[45]..\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60 or on (pod) (sum by (pod) (rate(twilight_http_requests_total{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\",pod=~\"${pod:regex}\",route!~\"GET /(healthz|readyz)\",route!~\"GET /sessions/[^/]+/events|POST /(progress|settlements|notices)\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60 * 0)",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}} · {{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "暂无样本",
          "unit": "suffix:次/分钟",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "普通 RPC：P95 耗时",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "description": "按 Pod/接口的直方图估计值：约95%的已完成短请求低于此值。排除探针和流式连接；低流量时精度有限，NaN 表示样本不足。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "twilight-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, pod, route) (rate(twilight_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\",pod=~\"${pod:regex}\",route!~\"GET /(healthz|readyz)\",route!~\"GET /sessions/[^/]+/events|POST /(progress|settlements|notices)\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}} · {{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "暂无样本",
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "nan",
                "result": {
                  "text": "样本不足"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "普通 RPC：当前活跃请求",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "description": "当前组件各 Pod 正在处理的普通请求，不含探针/流式端点。执行可在HTTP返回后继续，0不等于没有运行中的任务。15s抓取可能看不到很短的请求。旧版没有新指标时留空，不拿混合总数代替。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "twilight-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "twilight_http_requests_in_flight_by_class{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\",pod=~\"${pod:regex}\",class=\"rpc\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "暂无样本",
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "流式端点：当前活跃请求",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "description": "与普通 RPC 分开：events/progress/settlements/notices 的活跃请求，包含握手，不仅是已经接收的SSE连接。不用连接寿命冒充RPC延迟；长期保持非零可能正常。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "twilight-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "twilight_http_requests_in_flight_by_class{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\",pod=~\"${pod:regex}\",class=\"stream\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "暂无样本",
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "健康探针：完成数 / 分钟",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 37,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "description": "只有 /healthz 和 /readyz。即使没有对话也会有流量；状态503表示未就绪。探针不计入左上方的业务RPC速率/延迟。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "twilight-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (pod, route, status) (rate(twilight_http_requests_total{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\",pod=~\"${pod:regex}\",route=~\"GET /(healthz|readyz)\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}} · {{route}} · {{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "暂无样本",
          "unit": "suffix:次/分钟",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "操作结果：采样窗口内次数",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 44,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "description": "当前组件的 Session/dispatch/outcome/recover/backend 边界。每条线保留 Pod/operation/result。not_ready/owned 未必异常；没有样本不证明恢复路径已执行。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "twilight-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (pod, operation, result) (increase(twilight_operations_total{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\",pod=~\"${pod:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}} · {{operation}} · {{result}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "暂无样本",
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "title": "操作：P95 耗时",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 44,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "description": "对应具体边界操作，不是整轮对话耗时；慢 owner open/recover 与慢HTTP应分别定位。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "twilight-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, pod, operation) (rate(twilight_operation_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\",pod=~\"${pod:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}} · {{operation}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "暂无样本",
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "title": "内存：Go 堆 / 进程 RSS",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 51,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "description": "每个 Pod 分开。Go堆是进程内存的一部分，RSS还包含栈/运行时等；不要将两条线相加。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "twilight-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "go_memstats_heap_alloc_bytes{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\",pod=~\"${pod:regex}\"}",
          "legendFormat": "堆 · {{pod}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "process_resident_memory_bytes{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\",pod=~\"${pod:regex}\"}",
          "legendFormat": "RSS · {{pod}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "暂无样本",
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "title": "CPU：100% = 一个核",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 51,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "description": "进程CPU秒的增长速率；100%=使用一个CPU核，多核进程可能超过100%。不是整个节点的CPU使用率。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "twilight-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "rate(process_cpu_seconds_total{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\",pod=~\"${pod:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval]) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "暂无样本",
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "title": "当前组件日志（可展开详情搜索 Session / Execution）",
      "type": "logs",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 58,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 10
      },
      "description": "只显示当前组件/所选Pod的主container。动态ID保留在JSON正文；可在Explore继续用 |= 过滤。选定Pod后不会混入其他副本日志。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "twilight-loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{namespace=\"twilight-validation\",role=~\"${component:regex}\",pod=~\"${pod:regex}\",container=~\"${component:regex}\"}",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      }
    }
  ]
}
